            <title>[LU-12032] conf-sanity test_123F fails for separate MGS</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-12032</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href="https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/32721fba-307f-11e9-a05f-52540065bddc" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/sub_tests/32721fba-307f-11e9-a05f-52540065bddc&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Setting configuration parameters&lt;br/&gt;
CMD: onyx-33vm9 lctl set_param -F /tmp/f123F.conf-sanity.yaml&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: osc.lustre-OST0000-osc.max_dirty_mb=210&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: mdt.lustre-MDT0000.identity_upcall=/usr/sbin/l_getidentity&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: osc.lustre-OST0000-osc-MDT0000.max_dirty_mb=210&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: jobid_name=testname&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: jobid_name=jobid_name=%e.%u&lt;br/&gt;
set_param: jobid_var=testname&lt;br/&gt;
CMD: onyx-33vm9 /usr/sbin/lctl get_param jobid_var&lt;br/&gt;
CMD: onyx-33vm9 /usr/sbin/lctl set_param -P jobid_var=procname_uid&lt;br/&gt;
 conf-sanity test_123F: @@@@@@ FAIL: jobid_var=procname_uid is not testname &lt;br/&gt;
 Trace dump:&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/test-framework.sh:5837:error()&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/conf-sanity.sh:8614:test_123F()&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/test-framework.sh:6118:run_one()&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/test-framework.sh:6157:run_one_logged()&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/test-framework.sh:6004:run_test()&lt;br/&gt;
 = /usr/lib64/lustre/tests/conf-sanity.sh:8619:main()&lt;/p&gt;</description>
